{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026BRb7pAMYgn1794959047.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>正進行業務重整的Nike預期至2029年財年，公司收入才恢復行業平均增長水平。</p><p></p><p>美國運動品牌Nike舉行九年來首場投資者日，公司重申2027年財年的業績指引，料收入將繼續錄得高單位數跌幅，經營盈利下跌速度快過收入，至2028年財年，預期收入跌勢放緩，但經調整每股盈利仍輕微下滑。</p><p></p><p>大中華業務方面，料2027至2031年財年收入將維持持平。而中國市場渠道調整，預計將在短期內為公司帶來額外壓力，整體業務重塑工作料至2030年財年才能完成。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T00:42:54.306680+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":218,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T23:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T22:57:35.088901+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T00:36:18.953754+00:00","content_hash":"a6149ae121e12f25a17e574864339fcaa961f803dfe26eefce1d8de5268c6dde","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T00:42:54.306680+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}